    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that i've tried everything. i talk to people, i try to rest, i try to look for reasons to keep doing this whole \"living\" thing... but nothing changes. it's like i'm just stuck in this loop of being tired and being hollow. it feels so permanent. like there's no version of the future where i don't feel this heavy.",
